OL,3,ABurnham hails Greenland deal ahead of
OL,4,Aexpected first Trump meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has hailed a deal between
OL,7,FDenmark and the US to "strengthen
OL,8,Fsecurity in the Arctic" after the two
OL,9,Fcountries resolved a months-long feud
OL,10,Fover Greenland.
OL,12,FThe UK prime minister and his Danish
OL,13,Fcounterpart Mette Frederiksen "welcomed
OL,14,Fthe US's commitment to the region" in a
OL,15,Fcall on Sunday morning, Downing Street
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
